{% elif kind == 'drip1' %}
GETTING STARTED - {{ series.n }} OF {{ series.of }}

Ten minutes to your first working agent

Yesterday you joined AutoGPT. Today, let's make it earn its keep. The fastest
way to understand agents isn't reading about them - it's watching one do a job
you'd rather not do yourself.

1. Pick a job, not a demo.
   Something small and real: summarise your unread newsletters, watch a
   webpage for changes, draft replies to a form inbox.

2. Grab a Marketplace agent.
   Search for that job - most agents work out of the box, no building
   required on day one.

3. Connect one thing.
   A single account (say, Gmail or a webhook) is enough to see the whole
   loop run.

4. Press run, then schedule it.
   Run it once manually. Happy with the result? Set a schedule and it's off
   your plate for good.

Open the Marketplace: {{ urls.marketplace }}

Tomorrow: how to read what your agent did while you weren't looking.
